[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7680.95, "timestamp": "02:08:00", "text": "除此之外，你还会得到类似共同利益的利益。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7682.99, "timestamp": "02:08:02", "text": "或者别的什么。那还在吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7686.95, "timestamp": "02:08:06", "text": "事物？你好。我该怎么上去？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7689.75, "timestamp": "02:08:09", "text": "天哪，我以前玩那些游戏玩得不亦乐乎。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7692.91, "timestamp": "02:08:12", "text": "很久以前。无法获取"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7699.629, "timestamp": "02:08:19", "text": "这里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7703.589, "timestamp": "02:08:23", "text": "哎呀，我的天。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7705.229, "timestamp": "02:08:25", "text": "你好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7708.55, "timestamp": "02:08:28", "text": "富士山。这个游戏现在还支持矢量图形吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7712.189, "timestamp": "02:08:32", "text": "是的，确实如此。你好，Araxa。你好。"}]